  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nGiven : 13 ÷ 145 × 29 - 69 + 13 = ?\n\nAccording to the question, after '+' and '-' are interchanged and '×' and '÷' are interchanged:\n\n13 ÷ 145 × 29 - 69 + 13 = ? ⇒ 13 × 145 ÷ 29 + 69 - 13 = ?\n\n⇒ 13 × __**145 **____**÷**____** 29**__ + 69 - 13 = ?\n\n⇒ __**13 ×**____** 5**__ + 69 - 13 = ?\n\n⇒ __**6**____**5 **____**+ 69**__ - 13 = ?\n\n⇒ __134 - 13__ = ?\n\n⇒ 121 = ?\n\nHence, \"Option 4\" is the correct answer.",
